sequenceDiagram
  participant M as MacGuard
  participant O1 as Origin 1
  participant O2 as Origin 2 (if configured)
  participant L as Installed rules
  M->>O1: download release files
  O1--xM: timeout or incomplete
  M->>M: remove staging
  M->>O2: start again from the beginning
  O2--xM: unreachable
  M-->>L: previous rules stay in use
  M->>M: report the failure, nothing installed
